1 NOTE {geni:about_me} According to image 3 of http://bibliotecadigital.rah.es/dgbrah/i18n/consulta/registro.cmd?id=45592, Leonor Lasso de la Vega was sister of Garci Lasso de la Vega 
2 CONT
2 CONT She is also mentioned in the testament of her mother in August 14th, 1432 as sister of Inigo Lopez de Mendoza, Elvira de Mendoza and Gonzalo Ruiz de Mendoza. According to her mother's will she chose not to accept her part of her i
2 CONC nheritance. (Perez-Bustamante, Rogelio (1994). [http://elpleitodelosnuevevalles.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/04/EL-PLEITO-DE-LOS-VALLES-rpb.pdf "Testamento de Leonor de la Vega. El Pleito de los Valles"] (PDF) . pp. 396–400. p.399)
2 CONT
2 CONT Leonor Lasso de la Vega, her mother, was a Spanish noble woman from Cantabria and head of the prestigious House of Lasso de la Vega from 1367 - 1432. 
2 CONT
2 CONT A descendant of Charlemagne and almost all the Kings of Europe. Her tree is found at https://www.geni.com/people/Leonor-Lasso-de-la-Vega-se%C3%B1ora-de-la-Vega/6000000000675541182 (Select Direct Ancestors Only on "Preferences" at 
2 CONC the bottom of the tree for simplicity as well as choose all Ancestors on Ancestors to display)
2 CONT
2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Leonor_Lasso_de_la_Vega
