1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Álvaro Contreras y Carvajal (1480-15?) was a Spanish nobleman, Alcalde de la fortaleza de Mérida.
2 CONT
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Born in Extremadura, was the son of Fernán Núñez de Contreras and Sarra de Carvajal, daughter of Alvar García Bejarano. His wife was Juana, daughter of Francisco de Aponte and Juana Carrillo de Mendoza.
