1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Tía carnal del célebre Almirante de Castilla Mosén Rubín de Bracquemont, tronco de esta fastuosa casa castellana, que vino a Castilla al mando de los caballeros galos que auxiliaron al Rey Don Juan I en la batalla 
2 CONC de Aljubarrota y prestó luego importantes servicios a sus sucesor Don Enrique III. 
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Tía carnal del célebre Almirante de Castilla Mosén Rubín de Bracquemont, tronco de esta fastuosa casa castellana, que vino a Castilla al mando de los caballeros galos que auxiliaron al Rey Don Juan I en la batalla de Aljubarrota y
2 CONC  prestó luego importantes servicios a sus sucesor Don Enrique III. 
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Maria de Bracquemont Florenville et Sedan (1340 -?) casada por duas vezes, a primeira com João III de Bettencourt (1339 - 1364) e a segunda com Roger Suhart de Montreville.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Regnault de Braquemont. Wikipédia, a enciclopédia livre.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Regnault_de_Braquemont
2 CONT
2 CONT =========================================
2 CONT
2 CONT Marie de Bracquemont was also known as Maria de Braquemont. She was also known as Marie de Braquemont. She was also known as Maria de Bracamonte. She was also known as Maria de Braquemont Florenville e Sedan. She was also known as
2 CONC  Maria Bracamonte. She was born circa 1330 at Traversain, Normandy, France. She married Roger Suhart in 1375 at France.60 She and Roger Suhart resided after 1375 at Grainville-la-Teinturière, Cany-Barville, Dieppe, Seine-Maritime,
2 CONC  France.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Jean de Bethencourt (III) and Marie de Bracquemont were as follows:
2 CONT
2 CONT * 13 i. Gallien de Bethencourt was born circa 1360 at Béthencourt, Sigy-en-Bray, Argueil, Dieppe, Seine-Maritime, France. He died young and is often forgotten by many authors.
2 CONT
2 CONT * + 14 ii. Jean de Bethencourt (IV) was born in 1362 in the castle of Grainville-la-Teinturière, Cany-Barville, Dieppe, Seine-Maritime, France. He married Jeanne de Fayel, daughter of Guillaume de Fayel and Marguerite de Chatillon
2 CONC , on 30 Jan 1392 at Paris, France. He married Françoise de Calletot at France.
2 CONT
2 CONT * + 15 iii. Regnault de Bethencourt (IV) was born at France before 1364 the year his father died. He married Marie de Breauté at France. He married Felipa de Troyes, daughter of Guillaume de Fayel and Marguerite de Chatillon, on 1
2 CONC 4 Jul 1422 at France.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Bettencourts 1200-2000 - Generation Six. Disp. em: http://web.meganet.net/bettenco/bett0006.htm#id19333 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
