2 CONT John I of La Marck, born in  November 1410   and dead the  February 8 1470   (or after 1480 ), is lord of Arenberg, lord of Sedan from 1440 until February 8, 1470 or 1480, Aigremont, Neufchatel, of Lumain and Braquemont, Lord of D
2 CONC aigni (1462) and chamberlain of King Charles VII .  He is the son of Eberhard II von der Mark .  John I of La Marck married Anna von Virneburg.  His son Robert I of Marck-Arenberg succeeded to the throne of Sedan . 
2 CONT
