2 CONC s. Page 315. A.K.A. Alonso Davalos Saavedra, Marriage Notes for FRANCISCA ESTRADA-DE-LA-CABALLERIA and ALONSO DE AVALOS-SAAVEDRA: Marriage source:From the book, Who's Who of the Conquistadors by Hugh Thomas. Page 315.
