1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.fundacionmedinaceli.org/casaducal/fichaindividuo.aspx?id=7176 http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/SPANISH%20NOBILITY%20LATER%20MEDIEVAL%202.htm#PedroAlvarezOsoriodied1461A
