2 CONT
2 CONT When Alvaro Ibañez de Toledo y Salvadores was born in 1209, in Toledo, Castilla-La Mancha, Spain, his father, Juan Estébanez de Toledo, was 20 and his mother, María Salvadores, was 15. He had at least 3 sons and 1 daughter with Sa
2 CONC ncha Gutiérrez. In 1269, at the age of 60, his occupation was listed as alcalde mayor de Toledo. He died on 10 October 1306, in his hometown, at the age of 97.
