2 CONT * http://www.ourfamilyhistories.org/getperson.php?personID=I5537&tree=00
2 CONT * http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Treasurer_of_Calais
2 CONT * http://www.historyofparliamentonline.org/volume/1386-1421/member/blount-sir-walter-1403
