2 CONT His crime was bigamy filed by one of his wives in a Spanish court.She wasn't letting anyone take away her rights to all the benefits that came via mayorazgo. Too much was at stake. Half the New World.
2 CONT Was Admiral, Count of Veruga. A very unique individual. 
