1 NOTE Mis-informed Legend says Leonor was the "Servant of the Count", and widow of Juan Paraiso also a servant of the Count. I have found what I think are her parents. I don't think Juan Nunez de Prado was a "servant". He was a vassel o
2 CONC f Juan Ponce de Leon Ayala, but not a hand servant.
2 CONT Sources:
