2 CONT was the 4th Baron Sutton of Dudley[2] and heir to Dudley Castle. He was the son of Sir John de Sutton IV, 3rd Baron Sutton, and Joan  a descendant of the first Lord Dudley, Sir John de Sutton II (c.1310–1359 John married Constance
