2 CONT 7) Juan Comas, "Historical Reality and the Detractors of Father las Casas". In Juan Friede and Benjamin Keen (eds.), Bartolomé de las Casas in History: Toward an Understanding of the Man and his Work. Collection spéciale: CER. DeK
2 CONC alb: Northern Illinois University Press, p. 493.
2 CONT 8) "Codice Mendoza".  https://codicemendoza.inah.gob.mx/html/acerca.php?lang=english 
2 CONT
2 CONT Additional References:
