0 @N6000000002188342345@ NOTE Isabella I of Castile
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
1 CONT   (Redirected from Isabella I of Castille)
1 CONT Jump to: navigation, search
1 CONT "Isabella I" redirects here. For other uses, see Isabella I (disambiguation).
1 CONT Isabella I
1 CONT Reign December 10, 1474-November 26, 1504
1 CONT Born April 22, 1451
1 CONT Madrigal de las Altas Torres
1 CONT Died November 26, 1504 (aged 53)
1 CONT Medina del Campo
1 CONT Buried Capilla Real, Granada, Spain
1 CONT Predecessor Henry IV
1 CONT Successor Joanna and Philip I
1 CONT Consort to Ferdinand II of Aragon
1 CONT Issue Isabella of Asturias
1 CONT Juan, Prince of Asturias
1 CONT Joanna
1 CONT Maria of Aragon
1 CONT Catherine of Aragon
1 CONT Royal House House of Trastámara
