0 @N6000000005598912519@ NOTE AKA Catalina de Aragón
1 CONT Born: 16 Dec 1485
1 CONT Birthplace: Alcalá de Henares, Spain </geo/054/000112715/>
1 CONT Died: 7 Jan 1536
1 CONT Location of death: Kimbolton, Huntingdon, England
1 CONT Cause of death: Illness
